//: gui_font_registered_face_simple_glyph_indexed_action_summary_completed_owner_item_read: completed summary authority から classified point item を借用して読む
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]: F5nxe が checked completed evidence と registered collection authority を分離せず、PointX population に必要な point item と typed read error を取得できるようにします。
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]: immediate nested summary owner を借用し、`gui_font_registered_face_simple_glyph_indexed_action_summary_owner_item_read` を exactly once 呼びます。成功と失敗のどちらでも同じ completed owner を caller が保持し、raw summary owner、raw action owner、raw collection は公開しません。
//:
//: [計算量/けいさんりょう]: O(1) 時間、O(1) 追加領域です。
//:
//: neplg2:test[skip]
pub fn gui_font_registered_face_simple_glyph_indexed_action_summary_completed_owner_item_read %fn &GuiFontRegisteredFaceSimpleGlyphIndexedActionSummaryCompletedOwner fn i32 Result GuiSfntSimpleGlyphOutlinePointStreamItem GuiSfntSimpleGlyphOutlinePointStreamItemCollectionReadError \owner\item_index:
    let summary %&GuiFontRegisteredFaceSimpleGlyphIndexedActionSummaryOwner field::get_ref owner "summary"
    gui_font_registered_face_simple_glyph_indexed_action_summary_owner_item_read summary item_index

